  "headline": "Hydrochlorothiazide is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; current supply covers about 19 days at both Corvale sites",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include hydrochlorothiazide as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 231 tablets of the 25 mg presentation with a daily use of 11.6 tablets, providing 19.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 262 tablets of the same strength with a daily use of 13.8 tablets, providing 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based check notes FDA actions and weak links but no action before a posting at a registered plant, so the buyer should verify current supplier status.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E9", "E4", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top ranked alternate manufacturer is Accord Healthcare Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional alternate manufacturers include Actavis Pharma, Inc. and Aurobindo Pharma Limited, also not on the shortage list and with no identifiable plant on their labels.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
